NAME
    whoami - print the active shell account

SYNOPSIS
    whoami

DESCRIPTION
    Prints the account name active in the current shell session. Every
    shell starts as 'root'. Use su(1) to switch accounts.

EXAMPLES
    whoami

EXIT STATUS
    0   Always succeeds.

SEE ALSO
    who(1), su(1), useradd(1), userdel(1)
